  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For the rod: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>T</mtext><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>-</mo><mtext>mg</mtext><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#8467;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>m</mtext><msup><mi>&#8467;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mtext>a</mtext><mi>&#8467;</mi></mfrac></math> ...(i)<br /><br />For the: <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> ...(ii)<br /><br />Solving (i) and (ii) we get: <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image7-e05807fa-0976-475c-b507-830d4fa53781.jpg\" />",
